{
  "choices": [
    {
      "message": {
        "content": "{\n  \"shared_outline\": {\n    \"review_argument\": \"肠道微生物组与实体瘤 ICI 疗效的关联已在多项观察性研究中得到一致报告，特定菌属（Akkermansia、Bifidobacterium、Faecalibacterium）及代谢产物（肌苷、短链脂肪酸）与改善的临床结局相关。机制研究揭示肌苷通过抑制肿瘤细胞 UBA6 酶活性增强免疫原性的分子路径，并在 CheckMate 025 队列中获得人类血浆肌苷分层与 OS 相关的统计支持。然而，干预性证据仍处于早期阶段：FMT-LUMINate、TACITO 等 Phase 2 试验显示疗效信号，但样本量小、多为单臂设计或 Phase 2a RCT，且存在安全性顾虑。目前尚无已完成的大规模 III 期 RCT 确证微生物组干预的疗效，代谢物绝对浓度标准化测量亦缺乏。本综述的核心论点是：微生物组-ICI 关联具有生物学合理性和早期临床支持，但因果验证与临床转化需等待 III 期 RCT 结果及代谢物定量标准化。综述将严格区分观察性关联与干预性证据、动物模型机制与人类临床验证、Phase 2 信号与 Phase 3 确证，避免过度解读早期数据。\",\n    \"chapter_sequence\": [\n      \"Ch2_Clinical\",\n      \"Ch3_Mechanisms\",\n      \"Ch4_Context\",\n      \"Ch5_Interventions\",\n      \"Ch6_Challenges\"\n    ],\n    \"conceptual_framework\": {\n      \"evidence_hierarchy\": \"观察性队列 < Phase 1/2 干预试验 < Phase 3 RCT; 动物模型机制 < 人类临床验证\",\n      \"causality_distinction\": \"关联证据（HR, OR）≠ 因果机制；FMT 定植≠疗效保证；代谢物丰度≠功能活性\",\n      \"context_dependency\": \"微生物效应受肿瘤类型、ICI 方案、宿主因素（饮食、年龄、地理）、合并用药修饰\",\n      \"measurement_standards\": \"相对丰度（16S/宏基因组）≠ 绝对浓度；粪便样本≠肿瘤微环境；需同一患者多层面闭合链条\"\n    },\n    \"transition_logic\": \"Ch2 确立临床关联→Ch3 解析生物学机制→Ch4 解释异质性来源→Ch5 评估干预转化→Ch6 指出方法学缺口与未来方向\"\n  },\n  \"chapters\": [\n    {\n      \"chapter_id\": \"Ch2_Clinical\",\n      \"title\": \"肠道微生物组与 ICI 疗效的临床关联证据\",\n      \"coordinated_scope\": \"综合不同实体瘤中微生物特征（分类学、多样性、功能通路）与临床结局（ORR、PFS、OS）的观察性关联数据，明确抗生素/PPI 等药物暴露的负面影响，并初步提及干预性试验信号作为向 Ch5 的过渡。严格区分观察性关联（仅报告 HR/OR）与干预性因果证据，避免将早期 FMT 信号误读为确证性疗效。涵盖黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC、HCC、CRC 等实体瘤的 ICI 治疗队列。\",\n      \"boundary_clarifications\": [\n        \"与 Ch5 的边界：Ch2 仅报告干预试验的存在及主要结局信号（如 ORR 数值），不深入分析试验设计细节、安全性数据或供体筛选策略（这些归入 Ch5）\",\n        \"与 Ch3 的边界：Ch2 不深入解析分子机制（如 UBA6 抑制、HDAC 抑制），仅提及代谢物名称作为关联标志物\",\n        \"与 Ch4 的边界：Ch2 报告异质性现象（如不同瘤种结果不一致），但不深入分析修饰因素的具体机制（归入 Ch4）\"\n      ],\n      \"key_evidence_types\": [\n        \"观察性队列研究\",\n        \"荟萃分析\",\n        \"Phase 1/2 干预试验的主要结局数据（仅作为信号提及）\"\n      ],\n      \"excluded_source_handles\": [\n        \"P0404\",\n        \"P0492\",\n        \"P0256\",\n        \"P0508\",\n        \"P0549\",\n        \"P0009\",\n        \"P0114\"\n      ],\n      \"exclusion_reasons\": {\n        \"P0404\": \"甲状腺癌 ICI 疗效系统综述，未涉及肠道微生物组数据\",\n        \"P0492\": \"犬癌症免疫治疗微生物组研究，物种差异大\",\n        \"P0256\": \"TNBC ICI 治疗现状综述，未包含微生物组与疗效关联的具体数据\",\n        \"P0508\": \"抗生素对 I 期试验生存影响研究，核心结果缺失\",\n        \"P0549\": \"仅摘要且为概念性综述，缺乏具体临床关联数据\",\n        \"P0009\": \"侧重分子机制（肌苷-UBA6），临床数据仅为 CheckMate 025 分层，主要归入 Ch3\",\n        \"P0114\": \"机制研究摘要，缺乏独立临床队列关联数据，主要归入 Ch3\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"chapter_id\": \"Ch3_Mechanisms\",\n      \"title\": \"微生物调节免疫治疗的分子与细胞机制\",\n      \"coordinated_scope\": \"解析代谢物（肌苷、SCFAs、色氨酸衍生物、胆汁酸）、免疫细胞互作（DC 成熟、T 细胞启动）、抗原模拟及细菌易位等具体生物学路径。明确区分动物模型因果验证与人类观察性/替代标志物证据的界限。重点阐述肌苷-UBA6 轴的人类验证数据（CheckMate 025 队列肌苷分层、UBA6 表达验证队列 n=22），同时说明 SCFAs 等缺乏肿瘤微环境绝对浓度数据的局限。\",\n      \"boundary_clarifications\": [\n        \"与 Ch2 的边界：Ch3 不重复报告临床关联的 HR/OR 数值，专注于机制路径的生物学解释\",\n        \"与 Ch6 的边界：Ch3 报告具体机制的证据局限（如样本量 n=22），Ch6 讨论 broader 方法学挑战（如缺乏标准化测量协议）\",\n        \"与 Ch4 的边界：Ch3 阐述机制本身，Ch4 讨论情境因素（如饮食、抗生素）如何改变这些机制的底物水平\"\n      ],\n      \"key_evidence_types\": [\n        \"动物模型因果验证\",\n        \"人类队列代谢组学关联\",\n        \"体外机制实验\",\n        \"替代标志物验证（如 UBA6 IHC）\"\n      ],\n      \"excluded_source_handles\": [\n        \"P0577\",\n        \"P0578\",\n        \"P0104\",\n        \"P0590\",\n        \"P0591\"\n      ],\n      \"exclusion_reasons\": {\n        \"P0577\": \"主要为 FMT 干预试验临床结局，机制线索已在 P0092/P0503 中覆盖，归入 Ch5 更宜\",\n        \"P0578\": \"MITRIC 试验阴性结果及免疫微环境分析，属干预性证据，归入 Ch5\",\n        \"P0104\": \"主要为 NSCLC 队列微生物特征与 PFS 关联的观察性数据，缺乏具体分子机制，归入 Ch2\",\n        \"P0590\": \"同 P0578，为 MITRIC 试验结果，归入 Ch5\",\n        \"P0591\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验摘要，侧重临床结局与毒性，归入 Ch5\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"chapter_id\": \"Ch4_Context\",\n      \"title\": \"影响微生物组效应的情境因素\",\n      \"coordinated_scope\": \"解释 Ch2 中观察到的临床关联异质性，分析治疗方案（单药 vs 联合）、药物暴露（抗生素/PPI 时机与类别）、宿主特征（饮食、年龄、地理）及肿瘤类型（免疫原性、分子亚型）如何修饰微生物组 - 免疫互作。不包含 Ch3 的分子机制细节或 Ch5 的干预试验结果，仅讨论这些因素作为混杂或调节变量如何影响观察到的关联。\",\n      \"boundary_clarifications\": [\n        \"与 Ch2 的边界：Ch4 不重复报告关联数据，专注于解释为何不同研究结果不一致\",\n        \"与 Ch5 的边界：Ch4 讨论药物/饮食作为自然暴露的修饰作用，Ch5 讨论其作为主动干预策略的潜力\",\n        \"与 Ch6 的边界：Ch4 报告具体情境因素的实证数据，Ch6 讨论控制这些混杂因素的方法学挑战\"\n      ],\n      \"key_evidence_types\": [\n        \"亚组分析\",\n        \"药物暴露时序研究\",\n        \"饮食 - 微生物关联观察\",\n        \"跨队列/跨地域比较\"\n      ],\n      \"excluded_source_handles\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"chapter_id\": \"Ch5_Interventions\",\n      \"title\": \"微生物组干预策略的临床转化现状\",\n      \"coordinated_scope\": \"评估 FMT、活体生物药（LBP）、益生菌及饮食干预在实体瘤 ICI 治疗中的安全性与有效性证据。明确当前以 Phase 1/2 试验为主的证据等级，区分观察性关联与干预性因果证据。详细分析试验设计（单臂 vs RCT）、供体筛选、给药途径、安全性（irAEs）及患者选择对结果的影响。指出缺乏大规模 III 期 RCT 确证的关键缺口。\",\n      \"boundary_clarifications\": [\n        \"与 Ch2 的边界：Ch5 深入分析干预试验的设计细节、安全性数据及转化挑战，Ch2 仅提及主要结局信号\",\n        \"与 Ch3 的边界：Ch5 不重复机制细节，专注于干预策略的临床实施及结果\",\n        \"与 Ch6 的边界：Ch5 报告具体试验的局限性（如样本量 n=45），Ch6 讨论领域层面的证据缺口（如无 Phase 3）\"\n      ],\n      \"key_evidence_types\": [\n        \"Phase 1/2 临床试验\",\n        \"随机对照试验（Phase 2a）\",\n        \"安全性数据\",\n        \"供体筛选标准\"\n      ],\n      \"excluded_source_handles\": [\n        \"P0311\",\n        \"P0407\"\n      ],\n      \"exclusion_reasons\": {\n        \"P0311\": \"主要聚焦 CAR-T 疗法而非 ICI，缺乏实体瘤 ICI 干预的直接临床证据\",\n        \"P0407\": \"主要关注癌症相关贫血机制，ICI 疗效仅为次要观察点，缺乏干预性试验数据\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"chapter_id\": \"Ch6_Challenges\",\n      \"title\": \"方法学挑战与未来研究方向\",\n      \"coordinated_scope\": \"系统剖析限制肠道微生物组-ICI 关联转化为临床实践的方法学瓶颈。明确证据等级缺口（无 Phase 3 RCT）、检测技术异质性（代谢物定量、测序）、因果推断困难（混杂因素）及干预安全性。不产生新疗效结论，专注于证据边界分析。提出标准化（供体筛选、代谢物测量）与精准医疗（多组学闭合链条、AI 整合）建议。\",\n      \"boundary_clarifications\": [\n        \"与 Ch2-Ch5 的边界：Ch6 不重复具体研究结果，专注于综合各章证据后识别的领域层面缺口\",\n        \"与 Ch3 的边界：Ch6 讨论测量标准化的方法学需求，Ch3 报告具体机制验证中使用的测量方法\",\n        \"与 Ch5 的边界：Ch6 讨论 Phase 3 证据缺口的领域影响，Ch5 报告具体 Phase 2 试验结果\"\n      ],\n      \"key_evidence_types\": [\n        \"文献计量分析\",\n        \"方法学比较研究\",\n        \"标准化倡议文件\",\n        \"正在进行试验注册信息\"\n      ],\n      \"excluded_source_handles\": [\n        \"P0436\",\n        \"P0480\",\n        \"P0020\",\n        \"P0024\",\n        \"P0048\"\n      ],\n      \"exclusion_reasons\": {\n        \"P0436\": \"仅摘要且为研究方案，无结果数据\",\n        \"P0480\": \"研究方案，尚无结果\",\n        \"P0020\": \"聚焦精神疾病，非实体瘤 ICI 治疗\",\n        \"P0024\": \"聚焦 HIV 感染，非实体瘤 ICI 治疗\",\n        \"P0048\": \"聚焦慢性疼痛，非肿瘤免疫治疗\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"supplement_requests\": [\n    {\n      \"gap_id\": \"large_scale_rct_results\",\n      \"gap_question\": \"是否存在已完成的、大规模随机对照 III 期试验证实微生物组干预在 ICI 治疗患者中的疗效？\",\n      \"success_criteria\": \"确认是否有 Phase III RCT 完成并发表主要结局数据（OS/PFS），或确认仍处于'unmet'状态。\",\n      \"intended_use\": \"用于 Ch5 结论部分明确证据缺口，避免将 Phase 2 信号误读为确证疗效；支持 Ch6 关于未来研究优先事项的建议。\",\n      \"targeted_queries\": [\n        \"completed phase III randomized controlled trial microbiome intervention immune checkpoint inhibitor solid tumor\",\n        \"FMT phase III trial results immunotherapy cancer 2024 2025\",\n        \"CanBiome2 trial status primary endpoint results\"\n      ],\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch5_Interventions\",\n        \"Ch6_Challenges\"\n      ],\n      \"current_status\": \"unmet\",\n      \"merged_from\": [\n        \"Ch5_Interventions\",\n        \"Ch6_Challenges\",\n        \"unresolved_limits\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"gap_id\": \"specific_metabolite_quantification\",\n      \"gap_question\": \"人体肿瘤微环境或血清中关键代谢物（肌苷、短链脂肪酸）的绝对生理浓度标准化测量方法是否已建立？\",\n      \"success_criteria\": \"找到具体的标准化测量协议、参考范围或共识声明，或确认仍处于'partial'状态（仅有分层数据如 CheckMate 025 队列）。\",\n      \"intended_use\": \"用于 Ch3 讨论人类证据的定量缺口，纠正将小鼠模型浓度直接外推至人类的过度断言；支持 Ch6 关于代谢物定量标准化的建议。\",\n      \"targeted_queries\": [\n        \"standardized absolute quantification metabolite tumor microenvironment microbiome immunotherapy\",\n        \"consensus guidelines inosine short-chain fatty acids measurement cancer immunotherapy\",\n        \"human serum inosine concentration reference range immune checkpoint inhibitor\"\n      ],\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch3_Mechanisms\",\n        \"Ch6_Challenges\"\n      ],\n      \"current_status\": \"partial\",\n      \"merged_from\": [\n        \"Ch3_Mechanisms\",\n        \"Ch6_Challenges\",\n        \"unresolved_limits\"\n      ],\n      \"notes\": \"CheckMate 025 队列仅提供基于中位数分层的高低组别比较数据（高肌苷组中位 OS 33 个月 vs 低肌苷组 22 个月），缺乏绝对浓度标准化测量。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"gap_id\": \"antibiotic_class_specificity\",\n      \"gap_question\": \"不同类别抗生素（如β-内酰胺类 vs 氟喹诺酮类）对 ICI 疗效的负面影响是否存在显著差异，是否有特定类别相对安全？\",\n      \"success_criteria\": \"找到至少 2 项比较不同抗生素类别对 ICI 疗效影响的研究，或明确说明现有材料仅支持'广谱抗生素'整体效应。\",\n      \"intended_use\": \"用于 Ch4 T4_2 药物干扰部分，细化抗生素管理建议，避免一概而论。\",\n      \"targeted_queries\": [\n        \"antibiotic class specific impact on immune checkpoint inhibitor efficacy\",\n        \"fluoroquinolones versus beta-lactams immune checkpoint inhibitor survival\"\n      ],\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch4_Context\"\n      ],\n      \"current_status\": \"unmet\",\n      \"merged_from\": [\n        \"Ch4_Context\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"gap_id\": \"diet_microbiome_interaction_human\",\n      \"gap_question\": \"在人类 ICI 治疗队列中，是否有干预性研究证实特定饮食模式（如高纤维）通过改变微生物组直接改善了 ICI 疗效？\",\n      \"success_criteria\": \"找到 1 项人类饮食干预试验报告微生物组变化与 ICI 疗效的因果链条，或确认现有证据仅为观察性关联。\",\n      \"intended_use\": \"用于 Ch4 T4_3 宿主与环境部分，区分观察性关联与干预性证据，避免过度推荐饮食方案。\",\n      \"targeted_queries\": [\n        \"dietary intervention trial microbiome immune checkpoint inhibitor human\",\n        \"high fiber diet randomized trial immunotherapy efficacy\"\n      ],\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch4_Context\"\n      ],\n      \"current_status\": \"unmet\",\n      \"merged_from\": [\n        \"Ch4_Context\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"directed_reads\": [\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n      \"focus\": \"提取 NSCLC 化疗 - 免疫联合背景下产丁酸菌与 OS 关联的具体 HR 值及不同免疫方案（NIC vs PC）的差异数据。\",\n      \"paper_id\": \"8016df1aa5a8160b7ccd412fa6851a6a508e2731\",\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch2_Clinical\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"unavailable\",\n      \"reason\": \"directed_read_not_admitted\",\n      \"contingency_plan\": \"依赖其他可用来源（P0575、P0585 的其他分析）讨论治疗方案特异性，不得声称已获取该特定研究的数据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n      \"focus\": \"确认 FMT-LUMINate 试验中 NSCLC 与黑色素瘤队列的 ORR 具体数值及 3-4 级不良事件发生率，特别是双药 ICI 背景下的毒性信号。\",\n      \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch2_Clinical\",\n        \"Ch5_Interventions\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"completed\",\n      \"material_available\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n      \"focus\": \"获取 NSCLC 和黑色素瘤中微生物特征与生存/响应改善的定量荟萃效应量，用于支撑关联的一致性论述。\",\n      \"paper_id\": \"82318ae05cff1667b2348961675db67dee4d8360\",\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch2_Clinical\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0582\",\n      \"focus\": \"提取 CheckMate 025 队列肌苷分层与 OS 关联的具体统计值（P 值、HR），以及 UBA6 验证队列（n=22）的 ORR 与 UBA6 表达关联数据。\",\n      \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:252309032\",\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch3_Mechanisms\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"completed\",\n      \"material_available\": true,\n      \"notes\": \"已获取肌苷分层数据（高肌苷组中位 OS 33 个月 vs 低肌苷组 22 个月，P<0.01），但缺乏绝对浓度数值。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0092\",\n      \"focus\": \"提取粪便 SCFA 水平与 PD-1i 疗效（PFS）关联的具体统计值，以及丙酸作为独立预后因子的多变量分析结果。\",\n      \"paper_id\": null,\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch3_Mechanisms\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0503\",\n      \"focus\": \"提取不同代谢物（SCFAs、色氨酸衍生物、胆汁酸）在不同肿瘤及 ICI 靶点下的双向调节作用的具体案例及受体机制。\",\n      \"paper_id\": null,\n      \"assigned_chapters\": [\n        \"Ch3_Mechanisms\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"harmonization_notes\": {\n    \"chapter_boundary_resolutions\": [\n      \"Ch2 与 Ch5 的干预试验数据分工：Ch2 仅报告主要结局信号（如 ORR 数值）作为观察性关联的延伸，Ch5 深入分析试验设计、安全性及转化挑战。避免 Ch2 过度解读早期试验为确证证据。\",\n      \"Ch3 与 Ch6 的证据局限分工：Ch3 报告具体机制验证的样本量限制（如 UBA6 队列 n=22），Ch6 讨论领域层面的方法学缺口（如无 Phase 3 RCT、缺乏标准化测量协议）。\",\n      \"Ch4 与 Ch6 的混杂因素分工：Ch4 报告具体情境因素（抗生素时机、饮食模式）的实证数据，Ch6 讨论控制这些混杂因素的方法学挑战（如孟德尔随机化的局限）。\"\n    ],\n    \"supplement_gap_mergers\": [\n      \"large_scale_rct_results：原出现在 Ch5、Ch6 及 unresolved_limits 中，已合并为单一缺口，分配至 Ch5（证据缺口）和 Ch6（未来方向）。当前状态为 unmet，需在综述中明确标注为关键知识缺口。\",\n      \"specific_metabolite_quantification：原出现在 Ch3、Ch6 及 unresolved_limits 中，已合并为单一缺口，分配至 Ch3（机制验证局限）和 Ch6（标准化需求）。当前状态为 partial（CheckMate 025 仅有分层数据），需在综述中说明缺乏绝对浓度标准化测量。\"\n    ],\n    \"directed_read_consolidations\": [\n      \"P0585（JCOG2007）：原请求在 Ch2，但状态为 unavailable。需在 Ch2 中依赖其他可用来源（P0575、P0585 的其他分析）讨论治疗方案特异性，不得声称已获取该特定研究的数据。\",\n      \"P0583（FMT-LUMINate）：已在 level-1 tool results 中获取，材料可用于 Ch2（疗效信号）和 Ch5（安全性及试验设计分析）。\",\n      \"P0582（UBA6/肌苷）：已在 level-1 tool results 中获取，材料可用于 Ch3（机制验证），但需注意缺乏绝对浓度数值。\"\n    ],\n    \"source_routing_preservation\": \"所有已分配的来源（source_routing 中的 assigned 状态）均保留在相应章节中，未因章节协调而被移除。仅明确排除的来源（excluded_source_handles）被移除，并附有具体原因。\",\n    \"evidence_hierarchy_enforcement\": \"综述全文需严格执行证据等级区分：观察性关联（HR/OR）不得暗示因果；Phase 2 单臂试验结果不得暗示为确证性疗效；动物模型机制不得直接外推为人类临床事实。所有判断需附带研究设计类型、样本量及限制条件。\",\n    \"terminology_standardization\": {\n      \"ICI\": \"免疫检查点抑制剂（Immune Checkpoint Inhibitors），包括 PD-1/PD-L1、CTLA-4 抑制剂\",\n      \"FMT\": \"粪便微生物移植（Fecal Microbiota Transplantation）\",\n      \"LBP\": \"活体生物药（Live Biotherapeutic Products）\",\n      \"SCFAs\": \"短链脂肪酸（Short-Chain Fatty Acids）\",\n      \"TME\": \"肿瘤微环境（Tumor Microenvironment）\",\n      \"irAEs\": \"免疫相关不良事件（immune-related Adverse Events）\",\n      \"ORR/PFS/OS\": \"客观缓解率/无进展生存期/总生存期\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
        "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to act as a central review editor to harmonize chapter proposals for a systematic review on \"How does the gut microbiome modulate the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in solid tumours, and what mechanisms mediate that effect?\".\n\nI need to:\n1. Set one shared scope, ordered outline, chapter boundaries, concepts, terminology, and transitions.\n2. Remove overlap and resolve contradictions between proposals while preserving their broad useful source assignments.\n3. Do not replace routed literature with only deep-read seeds.\n4. Remove a routed source only when explicitly named in excluded_source_handles with a reason.\n5. Merge and deduplicate supplement gaps and directed-read tasks by source_handle while preserving all distinct questions and chapter_ids.\n6. Preserve valuable level-1 tool results and do not reacquire review-reported original full texts.\n7. Return shared_outline, chapters (with chapter_id and coordinated scope), supplement_requests, directed_reads, and harmonization_notes.\n\nKey constraints from the system prompt:\n- Return JSON only.\n- Use Chinese for chapter titles and content.\n- Preserve source_handle naming spaces.\n- Do not output source_handles/source_ids lists for each chapter (handled by local program).\n- Act as central review editor to reconcile chapter proposals before detailed expansion.\n- Set shared scope, ordered outline, chapter boundaries, concepts, terminology, and transitions.\n- Remove overlap and resolve contradictions.\n- Preserve routed literature.\n- Merge supplement gaps and directed reads.\n- Preserve level-1 tool results.\n\nFrom the input, I can see:\n- There are 5 chapters proposed (Ch2_Clinical, Ch3_Mechanisms, Ch4_Context, Ch5_Interventions, Ch6_Challenges).\n- There are unresolved limits regarding large_scale_rct_results and specific_metabolite_quantification.\n- There are supplement_requests and directed_reads in each chapter proposal.\n- There are source_routing assignments with interpretation_limits.\n\nMy task is to harmonize these proposals into a coordinated plan.\n\nKey harmonization tasks:\n1. Ensure chapter boundaries are clear and non-overlapping.\n2. Merge duplicate supplement_requests (e.g., large_scale_rct_results appears in Ch5 and Ch6).\n3. Merge duplicate directed_reads.\n4. Resolve any contradictions in chapter scopes.\n5. Ensure transitions between chapters are logical.\n6. Preserve all useful source assignments.\n7. Note any exclusions with reasons.\n\nLet me analyze the chapter proposals:\n\nCh2_Clinical: Clinical association evidence (observational studies, specific taxa, diversity, antibiotics/PPI effects, interventional signals).\nCh3_Mechanisms: Molecular and cellular mechanisms (metabolites, immune cell interactions, antigen mimicry, evidence limitations).\nCh4_Context: Contextual factors modifying microbiome effects (treatment regimens, drugs, host factors, tumor heterogeneity).\nCh5_Interventions: Clinical translation of intervention strategies (FMT, LBPs, probiotics, diet, safety, evidence hierarchy).\nCh6_Challenges: Methodological challenges and future directions (evidence gaps, measurement standardization, causal inference, safety/implementation, future framework).\n\nPotential overlaps to resolve:\n- Ch2 and Ch5 both discuss interventional trial data (Ch2 mentions intervention signals, Ch5 focuses on interventions). Need to clarify: Ch2 should focus on observational associations with brief mention of intervention signals as transition to Ch5; Ch5 should provide detailed intervention trial analysis.\n- Ch3 and Ch6 both discuss evidence limitations regarding mechanisms. Need to clarify: Ch3 focuses on specific mechanism evidence and its limitations; Ch6 focuses on broader methodological challenges.\n- Ch4 and Ch6 both discuss confounding factors. Need to clarify: Ch4 discusses specific contextual modifiers (drugs, diet, tumor type); Ch6 discusses broader methodological issues in establishing causality.\n\nSupplement requests to merge:\n- large_scale_rct_results: appears in Ch5 and Ch6 (and in unresolved_limits). Should be consolidated.\n- specific_metabolite_quantification: appears in Ch3 and Ch6 (and in unresolved_limits). Should be consolidated.\n- antibiotic_class_specificity: in Ch4.\n- diet_microbiome_interaction_human: in Ch4.\n\nDirected reads to merge:\n- P0585 (JCOG2007): requested in Ch2.\n- P0583 (FMT-LUMINate): requested in Ch2.\n- P0298 (Meta-analysis): requested in Ch2.\n- P0582 (UBA6/inosine): requested in Ch3.\n- P0092 (SCFAs): requested in Ch3.\n- P0503 (Metabolites): requested in Ch3.\n\nI need to ensure these are deduplicated and assigned to the most appropriate chapter.\n\nLet me create the harmonized output.",
